{"parse": {"title": "TTS-01", "pageid": 141707, "text": "<div class=\"mw-parser-output\"><div class=\"tabber no-indent\"><div class=\"episode-inter-nav\"><span style=\"display: inline-block; width: 28px;\"></span><span class=\"nav-page-name\">TTS-01</span><a href=\"/wiki/TTS-02\" title=\"TTS-02\"><img alt=\"Btn zuo.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/9a/Btn_zuo.png/18px-Btn_zuo.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"18\" height=\"26\" class=\"img-rotate\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/9a/Btn_zuo.png/27px-Btn_zuo.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/9a/Btn_zuo.png/36px-Btn_zuo.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"64\" data-file-height=\"92\" /></a></div><div class=\"episode-panel\"><div style=\"position: relative; padding-left: 35px;\"><div class=\"episode-deco\"><div class=\"episode-deco-1\"></div><div class=\"episode-deco-2\"></div><div class=\"episode-deco-3\"></div></div><div class=\"episode-index\"><span class=\"episode-index-chapter\">TTS</span><span class=\"episode-index-number\">01</span></div><h2 style=\"position:absolute; opacity:0; pointer-events:none;width:0; height:0; overflow:hidden;\"><span id=\".E4.B8.96.E7.BA.AA.E6.9C.AB.E7.9A.84.E5.BF.A7.E9.83.81\"></span><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"世纪末的忧郁\">世纪末的忧郁</span></h2><div class=\"episode-title\"> 世纪末的忧郁</div><div class=\"episode-subtitle\">\"Fin-de-Siècle\"</div></div><div><div class=\"episode-navbar\"><div class=\"tabber-filter auto-first\" style=\"display: flex; flex-wrap: wrap; margin: 0 -4px;\"></div></div></div></div><div class=\"episode-switchbtn\"><small style=\"color: #999;\">头像 <div class=\"switchbtn\" style=\"display: inline-block;\"><i class=\"mw-customtoggle-storyHeadicon mw-customtoggle-\"><img alt=\"显示\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2e/Btn_watch_nor.png/20px-Btn_watch_nor.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"显示\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" style=\"vertical-align: middle\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2e/Btn_watch_nor.png/30px-Btn_watch_nor.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2e/Btn_watch_nor.png/40px-Btn_watch_nor.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"56\" data-file-height=\"56\" /></i><i class=\"mw-customtoggle-storyHeadicon mw-customtoggle-\" style=\"display: none;\"><img alt=\"隐藏\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d2/Btn_watch_selected.png/20px-Btn_watch_selected.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"隐藏\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" style=\"vertical-align: middle\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d2/Btn_watch_selected.png/30px-Btn_watch_selected.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d2/Btn_watch_selected.png/40px-Btn_watch_selected.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"56\" data-file-height=\"56\" /></i></div></small> <small style=\"color: #999;\">背景图 <div class=\"switchbtn\" style=\"display: inline-block;\"><i class=\"mw-customtoggle-storyBg mw-customtoggle-\"><img alt=\"显示\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2e/Btn_watch_nor.png/20px-Btn_watch_nor.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"显示\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" style=\"vertical-align: middle\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2e/Btn_watch_nor.png/30px-Btn_watch_nor.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2e/Btn_watch_nor.png/40px-Btn_watch_nor.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"56\" data-file-height=\"56\" /></i><i class=\"mw-customtoggle-storyBg mw-customtoggle-\" style=\"display: none;\"><img alt=\"隐藏\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d2/Btn_watch_selected.png/20px-Btn_watch_selected.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"隐藏\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" style=\"vertical-align: middle\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d2/Btn_watch_selected.png/30px-Btn_watch_selected.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d2/Btn_watch_selected.png/40px-Btn_watch_selected.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"56\" data-file-height=\"56\" /></i></div></small></div><div class=\"episode-desc\"><div style=\"display:flex;\"><div style=\"flex-grow:1;\"><span class=\"color-value\"></span>从<span class=\"color-value\"></span>忧<span class=\"color-value\"></span>郁<span class=\"color-value\"></span>中<span class=\"color-value\"></span>来<span class=\"color-value\"></span>，<span class=\"color-value\"></span>回<span class=\"color-value\"></span>忧<span class=\"color-value\"></span>郁<span class=\"color-value\"></span>中<span class=\"color-value\"></span>去<span class=\"color-value\"></span>。<span class=\"color-value\"></span></div><div class=\"grey-small hide-m\" style=\"float:right;\">ID: 3810101</div></div></div><div class=\"battle-panel\"><div class=\"story no-indent\"><div class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyBg\"><a href=\"/wiki/%E6%96%87%E4%BB%B6:Cg-3_8_bg_01.png\" class=\"image\" title=\"3_8_bg_01\"><img alt=\"3_8_bg_01\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/e/e4/Cg-3_8_bg_01.png/600px-Cg-3_8_bg_01.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"600\" height=\"250\" class=\"story-bg\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/e/e4/Cg-3_8_bg_01.png/900px-Cg-3_8_bg_01.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/e/e4/Cg-3_8_bg_01.png/1200px-Cg-3_8_bg_01.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"2592\" data-file-height=\"1080\" /></a></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>“嘟——嘟——”</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"628220.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/8/8f/HeadIconSmall-628220.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-628220.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"628220.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/8/8f/HeadIconSmall-628220.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-628220.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/8/8f/HeadIconSmall-628220.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-628220.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">汉娜：</div><div>你好？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"650212.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/7/79/HeadIconSmall-650212.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-650212.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"650212.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/7/79/HeadIconSmall-650212.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-650212.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/7/79/HeadIconSmall-650212.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-650212.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">蓝图：</div><div>汉娜，谢天谢地你还在……爸爸妈妈呢？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"628220.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/8/8f/HeadIconSmall-628220.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-628220.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"628220.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/8/8f/HeadIconSmall-628220.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-628220.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/8/8f/HeadIconSmall-628220.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-628220.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">汉娜：</div><div>在我身边……我们都吓坏了，姐姐。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"628220.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/8/8f/HeadIconSmall-628220.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-628220.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"628220.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/8/8f/HeadIconSmall-628220.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-628220.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/8/8f/HeadIconSmall-628220.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-628220.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">汉娜：</div><div>怪事一桩接着一桩，人们像疯了一样……还有雨……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"650219.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/4/44/HeadIconSmall-650219.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-650219.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"650219.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/4/44/HeadIconSmall-650219.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-650219.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/4/44/HeadIconSmall-650219.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-650219.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">蓝图：</div><div>听着，把门窗锁好，别出去，也别碰那些雨。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"628220.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/8/8f/HeadIconSmall-628220.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-628220.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"628220.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/8/8f/HeadIconSmall-628220.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-628220.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/8/8f/HeadIconSmall-628220.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-628220.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">汉娜：</div><div>你知道些什么，对吗，艾达？你在那个什么基金会里……告诉我，这不是……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>世界末日——</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"650202.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/0/01/HeadIconSmall-650202.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-650202.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"650202.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/0/01/HeadIconSmall-650202.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-650202.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/0/01/HeadIconSmall-650202.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-650202.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">蓝图：</div><div>这当然不是世界末日。这只是一场雨。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"650202.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/0/01/HeadIconSmall-650202.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-650202.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"650202.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/0/01/HeadIconSmall-650202.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-650202.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/0/01/HeadIconSmall-650202.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-650202.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">蓝图：</div><div>它带走了地球上绝大多数人口，其中也包括我的亲人。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"650202.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/0/01/HeadIconSmall-650202.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-650202.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"650202.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/0/01/HeadIconSmall-650202.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-650202.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/0/01/HeadIconSmall-650202.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-650202.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">蓝图：</div><div>世界将我们带回了1996年。尽管只是三年之前，但所有事物的样貌都变得截然不同。</div></div><div class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyBg\"><a href=\"/wiki/%E6%96%87%E4%BB%B6:Cg-jijinhuidatang.png\" class=\"image\" title=\"jijinhuidatang\"><img alt=\"jijinhuidatang\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/66/Cg-jijinhuidatang.png/600px-Cg-jijinhuidatang.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"600\" height=\"250\" class=\"story-bg\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/66/Cg-jijinhuidatang.png/900px-Cg-jijinhuidatang.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/66/Cg-jijinhuidatang.png/1200px-Cg-jijinhuidatang.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"2592\" data-file-height=\"1080\" /></a></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div><span style=\"text-align:right\"><i>“基金会总部……已塌陷……系统全面失效……”</i></span><br /><br /><br /><br /><br /><br /><br /><br /><br /><br /></div></div><div class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyBg\"><a href=\"/wiki/%E6%96%87%E4%BB%B6:Cg-lapulasidatang2.png\" class=\"image\" title=\"lapulasidatang2\"><img alt=\"lapulasidatang2\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/e/ec/Cg-lapulasidatang2.png/600px-Cg-lapulasidatang2.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"600\" height=\"250\" class=\"story-bg\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/e/ec/Cg-lapulasidatang2.png/900px-Cg-lapulasidatang2.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/e/ec/Cg-lapulasidatang2.png/1200px-Cg-lapulasidatang2.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"2592\" data-file-height=\"1080\" /></a></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div><br /><br /><br /><br /><br /><br /><br /><br /><br /><br /><br /><br /><br /><br /><br /><span style=\"text-align:left\"><i>“很遗憾，在这起灾害中，拉普拉斯失去了负责人……我们将持续关注……”</i></span></div></div><div class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyBg\"><a href=\"/wiki/%E6%96%87%E4%BB%B6:Cg-jijinhuiyishiting.png\" class=\"image\" title=\"jijinhuiyishiting\"><img alt=\"jijinhuiyishiting\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/1/1f/Cg-jijinhuiyishiting.png/600px-Cg-jijinhuiyishiting.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"600\" height=\"250\" class=\"story-bg\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/1/1f/Cg-jijinhuiyishiting.png/900px-Cg-jijinhuiyishiting.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/1/1f/Cg-jijinhuiyishiting.png/1200px-Cg-jijinhuiyishiting.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"2592\" data-file-height=\"1080\" /></a></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div><span style=\"font-size:116%\"><i>“重塑之手不会止步于此……必须采取一切必要的措施……”</i></span></div></div><div class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyBg\"><a href=\"/wiki/%E6%96%87%E4%BB%B6:Cg-1_9_bg_luxibangongshi.png\" class=\"image\" title=\"1_9_bg_luxibangongshi\"><img alt=\"1_9_bg_luxibangongshi\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/e/e5/Cg-1_9_bg_luxibangongshi.png/600px-Cg-1_9_bg_luxibangongshi.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"600\" height=\"250\" class=\"story-bg\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/e/e5/Cg-1_9_bg_luxibangongshi.png/900px-Cg-1_9_bg_luxibangongshi.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/e/e5/Cg-1_9_bg_luxibangongshi.png/1200px-Cg-1_9_bg_luxibangongshi.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"2592\" data-file-height=\"1080\" /></a></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div><br /><br /><br /><br /><br /><br /><br /><i>“根据……我们认为它事实上已经成为了一种不可逆的、可持续的‘时空灾害’现象。”</i></div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>1999年12月31日，我们的生活被永远改变了。</div></div><div class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyBg\"><a href=\"/wiki/%E6%96%87%E4%BB%B6:Cg-weiyuanhuihuiyishi.png\" class=\"image\" title=\"weiyuanhuihuiyishi\"><img alt=\"weiyuanhuihuiyishi\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/b/be/Cg-weiyuanhuihuiyishi.png/600px-Cg-weiyuanhuihuiyishi.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"600\" height=\"250\" class=\"story-bg\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/b/be/Cg-weiyuanhuihuiyishi.png/900px-Cg-weiyuanhuihuiyishi.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/b/be/Cg-weiyuanhuihuiyishi.png/1200px-Cg-weiyuanhuihuiyishi.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"2592\" data-file-height=\"1080\" /></a></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"308601.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/f/fa/HeadIconSmall-308601.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-308601.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"308601.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/f/fa/HeadIconSmall-308601.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-308601.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/f/fa/HeadIconSmall-308601.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-308601.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">露西：</div><div>异象记录已确认：群体癔症、雨水倒流……最终演化为时间回退、空间紊乱，其结果呈不可逆特征。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"308601.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/f/fa/HeadIconSmall-308601.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-308601.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"308601.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/f/fa/HeadIconSmall-308601.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-308601.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/f/fa/HeadIconSmall-308601.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-308601.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">露西：</div><div>为降低沟通成本，本次异象暂命名为“时空灾害”。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"308601.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/f/fa/HeadIconSmall-308601.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-308601.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"308601.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/f/fa/HeadIconSmall-308601.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-308601.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/f/fa/HeadIconSmall-308601.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-308601.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">露西：</div><div>目前仅能确认其与重塑之手的某种术式存在因果关系。其科学机制无法解析，暂不做无意义推测。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"308601.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/f/fa/HeadIconSmall-308601.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-308601.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"308601.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/f/fa/HeadIconSmall-308601.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-308601.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/f/fa/HeadIconSmall-308601.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-308601.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">露西：</div><div>当然，该问题不属于本次会议讨论范围。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"308601.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/f/fa/HeadIconSmall-308601.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-308601.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"308601.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/f/fa/HeadIconSmall-308601.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-308601.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/f/fa/HeadIconSmall-308601.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-308601.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">露西：</div><div>今日拉普拉斯汇报的主题是：有关“时空灾害”防御工作的阶段性进展。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>冰冷、无机质的声音回荡在室内。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>年轻的职员们开始窃窃私语。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"506101.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/f/fb/HeadIconSmall-506101.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-506101.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"506101.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/f/fb/HeadIconSmall-506101.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-506101.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/f/fb/HeadIconSmall-506101.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-506101.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">基金会职员Ⅰ：</div><div>那位台前汇报的……露西女士，之前我从未见过。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"508601.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/0/09/HeadIconSmall-508601.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-508601.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"508601.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/0/09/HeadIconSmall-508601.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-508601.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/0/09/HeadIconSmall-508601.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-508601.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">基金会职员Ⅱ：</div><div>她曾是拉普拉斯在纽约第三分部的负责人，现在负责“时空灾害”研究。他们的头儿也被灾害带走了，新负责人每天忙得焦头烂额，这才把这位女士推到台前。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"506101.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/f/fb/HeadIconSmall-506101.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-506101.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"506101.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/f/fb/HeadIconSmall-506101.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-506101.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/f/fb/HeadIconSmall-506101.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-506101.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">基金会职员Ⅰ：</div><div>哦，临危受命。和我们部门一样——谁活下来，谁就能升任主管。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"514301.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/c/c9/HeadIconSmall-514301.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-514301.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"514301.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/c/c9/HeadIconSmall-514301.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-514301.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/c/c9/HeadIconSmall-514301.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-514301.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">基金会职员Ⅲ：</div><div>这已经算幸运了。听说隔壁有的部门连一个人都不剩了……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"650210.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/0/0e/HeadIconSmall-650210.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-650210.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"650210.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/0/0e/HeadIconSmall-650210.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-650210.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/0/0e/HeadIconSmall-650210.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-650210.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">蓝图：</div><div>闭嘴，芬恩。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>黑发职员头也不抬，她的笔尖落在纸上，发出拖长的“刷刷”声。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">蓝图：</div><div>专心听报告，那位露西女士的发言很重要。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"514301.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/c/c9/HeadIconSmall-514301.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-514301.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"514301.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/c/c9/HeadIconSmall-514301.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-514301.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/c/c9/HeadIconSmall-514301.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-514301.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">基金会职员Ⅲ：</div><div>嗯……我在想，这世上还有什么是真正重要的事吗？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"514301.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/c/c9/HeadIconSmall-514301.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-514301.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"514301.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/c/c9/HeadIconSmall-514301.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-514301.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/c/c9/HeadIconSmall-514301.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-514301.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">基金会职员Ⅲ：</div><div>在一场毫无来由的所谓“时空灾害”会将一切都冲刷殆尽的前提下。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">蓝图：</div><div>听报告。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"514301.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/c/c9/HeadIconSmall-514301.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-514301.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"514301.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/c/c9/HeadIconSmall-514301.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-514301.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/c/c9/HeadIconSmall-514301.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-514301.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">基金会职员Ⅲ：</div><div>……好咯。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>职员耸了耸肩，视线再度滑到主讲人身上。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">露西：</div><div>基于远在前线的伊戈尔将军的佐证，以及电压摄像技术的比对结果——</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">露西：</div><div>我们猜想，基金会总部外存在能够免疫“时空灾害”的区域。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">众人：</div><div>……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"650215.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/0/0e/HeadIconSmall-650215.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-650215.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"650215.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/0/0e/HeadIconSmall-650215.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-650215.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/0/0e/HeadIconSmall-650215.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-650215.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">蓝图：</div><div>免疫……“时空灾害”？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">露西：</div><div>目前尚无法判定“时空灾害”是否必然伴随时间逆流。为便于讨论，我们将此类区域统称为“不可回溯地”。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">露西：</div><div>另外，本次会议目的在于形成行动共识，而非展开学术论证。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">露西：</div><div>因此我会省略推导，直接展示结论——</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>幻灯片切换至下一张。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>那是一张世界地图。零星的蓝色光点散落其中，散发出柔和的光晕。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"308601.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/f/fa/HeadIconSmall-308601.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-308601.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"308601.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/f/fa/HeadIconSmall-308601.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-308601.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/f/fa/HeadIconSmall-308601.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-308601.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">露西：</div><div>结论就是——这几个蓝色的光点。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"308601.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/f/fa/HeadIconSmall-308601.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-308601.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"308601.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/f/fa/HeadIconSmall-308601.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-308601.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/f/fa/HeadIconSmall-308601.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-308601.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">露西：</div><div>它们均已通过理论模型验证，是具有一定几率免疫“时空灾害”的候选地点。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"506101.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/f/fb/HeadIconSmall-506101.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-506101.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"506101.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/f/fb/HeadIconSmall-506101.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-506101.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/f/fb/HeadIconSmall-506101.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-506101.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">基金会职员Ⅰ：</div><div>免疫“时空灾害”？如果理论真的成立……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>席间讨论声不断。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>这一美好的愿景像是无形的风，将人们从漫长的昏睡中唤醒。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"508601.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/0/09/HeadIconSmall-508601.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-508601.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"508601.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/0/09/HeadIconSmall-508601.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-508601.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/0/09/HeadIconSmall-508601.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-508601.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">基金会职员Ⅱ：</div><div>这样一来，我们或许可以将数据中心、样本库和军备设施都迁移过去，至少能保住关键资产……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"650113.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/28/HeadIconSmall-650113.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-650113.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"650113.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/28/HeadIconSmall-650113.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-650113.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/28/HeadIconSmall-650113.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-650113.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">红发的女士：</div><div>不只是数据中心那么简单。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>一位女士从席位间站起。动作不大，却让周围迅速安静下来。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">红发的女士：</div><div>诸位，请允许我补充一个更长远的方向。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">肯纳：</div><div>我叫肯纳，新近由基金会格拉斯哥办事处调任至工程部。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">肯纳：</div><div>在此次会议召开前，我作为工程部的对接责任人，参与了“时空灾害”防御工作可行性的前期勘探与调研评估。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>简短的介绍后，她对着会议主持人微微颔首，迅速抛出关键的议题。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">肯纳：</div><div>如露西女士所言，我们今天坐在这里讨论的，是如何防御“时空灾害”。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">肯纳：</div><div>如果“不可回溯地”确实存在，那么它不仅能容纳基金会的数据库与军备设施——</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">肯纳：</div><div>未来，它也应当具备成为基金会办事处，甚至分部的条件。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>“分部”两个字落下时，会议室瞬间炸开。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"514301.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/c/c9/HeadIconSmall-514301.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-514301.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"514301.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/c/c9/HeadIconSmall-514301.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-514301.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/c/c9/HeadIconSmall-514301.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-514301.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">基金会职员Ⅲ：</div><div>不错的愿景，不过是否来得有些太早了？总部大楼的边梁现在还歪着。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"508601.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/0/09/HeadIconSmall-508601.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-508601.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"508601.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/0/09/HeadIconSmall-508601.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-508601.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/0/09/HeadIconSmall-508601.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-508601.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">基金会职员Ⅱ：</div><div>可如果真能做到，那局面就完全不一样了……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>待议论声逐渐平息，肯纳抬眼扫过众人，随即继续发言。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">肯纳：</div><div>今后，我将与委员伊里内伊——也就是“新办事处建设”项目负责人，共同推进后续计划。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">肯纳：</div><div>从勘探、选址到安全评估，我们会给出可执行的建设方案。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"649403.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/5/5b/HeadIconSmall-649403.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-649403.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"649403.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/5/5b/HeadIconSmall-649403.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-649403.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/5/5b/HeadIconSmall-649403.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-649403.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">伊里内伊：</div><div>……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>端坐在会议室中央的男人轻轻颔首。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"649403.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/5/5b/HeadIconSmall-649403.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-649403.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"649403.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/5/5b/HeadIconSmall-649403.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-649403.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/5/5b/HeadIconSmall-649403.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-649403.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">伊里内伊：</div><div>目前还只是理论推演。我们将持续派遣专业人员实地勘察，以确认可行性。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">肯纳：</div><div>……没错。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">肯纳：</div><div>经过会长决议，由拉普拉斯理论模型推算出的以上地点中，已派遣调查员首先前往的是——</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"650102.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d8/HeadIconSmall-650102.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-650102.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"650102.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d8/HeadIconSmall-650102.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-650102.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d8/HeadIconSmall-650102.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-650102.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">肯纳：</div><div>位于东欧的诺瓦米奇。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>众人的目光锁定在那唯一的暗红光点上。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"650215.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/0/0e/HeadIconSmall-650215.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-650215.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"650215.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/0/0e/HeadIconSmall-650215.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-650215.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/0/0e/HeadIconSmall-650215.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-650215.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">蓝图：</div><div>嗯？这是……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>它位于欧亚大陆板块中央偏右的位置，正有节奏地闪烁着。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>一颗孤独的、小小的心脏。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"650113.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/28/HeadIconSmall-650113.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-650113.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"650113.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/28/HeadIconSmall-650113.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-650113.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/28/HeadIconSmall-650113.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-650113.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">肯纳：</div><div>工业废墟、运河、伏特加——它们足以概括这座小城市的全部。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>她从手头厚厚的资料中抬起头，视线落在墙角边一排年轻职员身上。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">肯纳：</div><div>柏林以东小姐已经在这里取得了一些调查进展。基于她的请求，我们将会增派一组在建筑领域有一定经验的专员。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"514301.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/c/c9/HeadIconSmall-514301.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-514301.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"514301.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/c/c9/HeadIconSmall-514301.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-514301.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/c/c9/HeadIconSmall-514301.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-514301.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">基金会职员Ⅲ：</div><div>噢……我猜，这就是我们受邀参加这场会议的原因了。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"650202.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/0/01/HeadIconSmall-650202.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-650202.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"650202.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/0/01/HeadIconSmall-650202.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-650202.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/0/01/HeadIconSmall-650202.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-650202.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">蓝图：</div><div>抱歉，我尚未理解这项调查与建筑之间的关联性。能进一步阐释原因吗？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">肯纳：</div><div>虽说这的确有些难以置信，但根据柏林以东小姐的形容……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>她停顿了一瞬。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">肯纳：</div><div>诺瓦米奇的“不可回溯地”，与一栋建筑有关。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"509201.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/e/ee/HeadIconSmall-509201.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-509201.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"509201.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/e/ee/HeadIconSmall-509201.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-509201.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/e/ee/HeadIconSmall-509201.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-509201.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">委员Ⅰ：</div><div>建筑，不是土地？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">肯纳：</div><div>是的。这栋建筑的建设年代与设计者均无法考证，再加上“时空灾害”引发的信息错位与缺失，目前未能检索到任何相关图纸或档案资料。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">肯纳：</div><div>此外，根据柏林以东小姐的记录，该建筑内部出现了多项……“异常情况”。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">肯纳：</div><div>我们推测，这些异常或许与其在“时空灾害”中表现出的免疫特征有关……</div></div><div class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyBg\"><a href=\"/wiki/%E6%96%87%E4%BB%B6:Cg-jijinhuizoulang2.png\" class=\"image\" title=\"jijinhuizoulang2\"><img alt=\"jijinhuizoulang2\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/b/b1/Cg-jijinhuizoulang2.png/600px-Cg-jijinhuizoulang2.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"600\" height=\"250\" class=\"story-bg\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/b/b1/Cg-jijinhuizoulang2.png/900px-Cg-jijinhuizoulang2.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/b/b1/Cg-jijinhuizoulang2.png/1200px-Cg-jijinhuizoulang2.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"2592\" data-file-height=\"1080\" /></a></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">伊里内伊：</div><div>蓝图。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>会议结束后，委员在散开的人群中叫住自己的下属。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">蓝图：</div><div>伊里内伊先生。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">伊里内伊：</div><div>你看起来对这个任务不太感兴趣。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">蓝图：</div><div>您指去诺瓦米奇调查那个什么……建筑吗？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">蓝图：</div><div>老实说，没有。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>她开门见山。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">蓝图：</div><div>职员们都在猜想，这起“时空灾害”并非天灾——它是由重塑之手亲手制造出来的。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">蓝图：</div><div>因此我们需要防御的并非某种“灾害”，而是制造“灾害”的敌人。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">蓝图：</div><div>与其把人手押在诺瓦米奇的建筑勘探上，不如投放到反制术式、情报追踪和军备部署上。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">蓝图：</div><div>否则就算找到一百个安全区域，只要重塑之手想毁掉它们，我们照样难以守住。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">伊里内伊：</div><div>看来我们持有相同意见。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">伊里内伊：</div><div>但肯纳女士一派有自己的看法——“重点在于信息获取”。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">伊里内伊：</div><div>她坚持认为，我们需要从时代中保存更多力量——与“不可回溯地”建立联系，获取外部世界信息，甚至建立观察站和基金会分部……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">蓝图：</div><div>我理解。只是……那听上去太过遥远了。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">蓝图：</div><div>我们生活了这么久的世界都能这样轻易被抹去，谁又能保证这个时代不会转瞬即逝呢？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">蓝图：</div><div>到那时，我们从外部获取的信息还有价值吗？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>他们都不再言语。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>走廊早已不复往日的喧闹。零星职员穿行其中，如同日光下悄无声息的白色幽灵。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">蓝图：</div><div>人们都很低落。一切都变了——熟悉的事物、亲朋，甚至时间本身。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">蓝图：</div><div>当然，我依然会完成任务。这是工作。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">伊里内伊：</div><div>这点我从未担心。即将和你一同执行任务的那位建筑师——奠基石，也是你的老熟人了。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">伊里内伊：</div><div>诺瓦米奇也是她的故乡，相信你们这趟东欧之行的体验不至于太差。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">蓝图：</div><div>奠基石……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>在念出这个名字时，监工的嘴角忍不住地抽动了一瞬。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">蓝图：</div><div>在上一次的合作中，我和她因为伦敦分部外立面的选材问题大吵一架。如果我没记错，当时您也在场。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">伊里内伊：</div><div>但你们也共同完成了许多广受好评的建筑项目，不是吗？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">伊里内伊：</div><div>这是工作——就像你刚才说的。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">蓝图：</div><div>嗯哼。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">伊里内伊：</div><div>不用有太大压力，蓝图。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">伊里内伊：</div><div>某种意义上，我部分同意肯纳女士的看法——重点在于信息获取。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">伊里内伊：</div><div>这次任务有利于帮助我们掌握外界的关键资源，确认战略，防御“时空灾害”，甚至对重塑之手发起反攻……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">伊里内伊：</div><div>我与肯纳女士虽同为项目负责人，但都有各自的活儿要忙。你是我的部下，只需要向我汇报。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">伊里内伊：</div><div>名义上，你是那位建筑师的助手。仅此而已。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>他停顿片刻，话外的意思早已不言自明。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">蓝图：</div><div>……我明白了。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">伊里内伊：</div><div>在你出发前，我必须为你补充一些不适合在会议上公布的信息。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">伊里内伊：</div><div>如肯纳女士刚才所言，那栋建筑的确有一些“异常情况”。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">蓝图：</div><div>请更加具体一些。什么性质的异常？严重性如何？是否足以对调查员的生命构成威胁？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">伊里内伊：</div><div>这是柏林以东小姐最新发来的一份报告，里面的记录或许对你有所帮助。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>蓝图接过报告。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">蓝图：</div><div>我与柏林以东小姐相识已久，她的确是个情报收集的好手。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>纸页飞速翻飞，事无巨细地记录了那个遥远小城的人们日常的饮食、起居……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">蓝图：</div><div>噢，找到了——“异常记录总览”。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">蓝图：</div><div>消失的居民……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">蓝图：</div><div>奇怪的声音、木偶……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">蓝图：</div><div>以及……“女鬼”？</div></div><div class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyBg\"><a href=\"/wiki/%E6%96%87%E4%BB%B6:Cg-jijinhuizoulang2.png\" class=\"image\" title=\"jijinhuizoulang2\"><img alt=\"jijinhuizoulang2\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/b/b1/Cg-jijinhuizoulang2.png/600px-Cg-jijinhuizoulang2.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"600\" height=\"250\" class=\"story-bg\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/b/b1/Cg-jijinhuizoulang2.png/900px-Cg-jijinhuizoulang2.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/b/b1/Cg-jijinhuizoulang2.png/1200px-Cg-jijinhuizoulang2.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"2592\" data-file-height=\"1080\" /></a></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"650223.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/99/HeadIconSmall-650223.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-650223.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"650223.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/99/HeadIconSmall-650223.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-650223.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/99/HeadIconSmall-650223.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-650223.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">蓝图：</div><div>……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>她收起报告，神色不虞。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">蓝图：</div><div>伊里内伊先生，我无法仅凭只言片语的传说来进行任何科学或合理的准备。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">伊里内伊：</div><div>与柏林以东小姐会面后，她会与你们同步更具体的内容。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>委员拍了拍蓝图的肩膀。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">伊里内伊：</div><div>找到“不可回溯地”，确认项目可行性，然后回来报到。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">伊里内伊：</div><div>不要做多余的工作。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">伊里内伊：</div><div>你是一个务实的人，知道自己该做什么。</div></div></div></div></div></div>", "categories": [{"sortkey": "", "category": "没有战斗的章节", "hidden": true}, {"sortkey": "", "category": "章节"}], "displaytitle": "TTS-01"}}